SetupDlg	Title	Text	20	12	330	18	3		{\TitleFont}Install the SohobOTP Agent		
SetupDlg	Intro	Text	20	34	330	28	3		Copy these values from the portal: Endpoints > Enrol endpoints > Create token. The computer then registers itself and receives its two-factor policy.		
